 orchestral score that was awesome  in the quick shot of Peters passport we  see that his birthday is August 10th the  character of spider-man first appeared  in the August 1962 issue of Marvel's  amazing fantasy so this checks out in  the quick shot of Peters luggage note  that it has the monogram BFP  this is most likely Ben F Parker aka  Peters Uncle Ben oh that's sweet  that was just about everything we saw  but we don't know everything just most  things so if you notice something we  didn't mention hit us up in the comments  and let us hear about it
 

